Public (not private) strong-name keys, as hex text, so that from-source
assemblies can be *public-signed* (csc -publicsign) and keep the exact
assembly identities (name, version, PublicKeyToken) of the upstream
assemblies they replace.  These are data, not code: the 160-byte RSA public
key blobs as embedded in any assembly signed with them.  They were read with
monodis from assemblies of the trusted MSYS2 mono 6.12 package; the token in
each file name is SHA-1(key)[last 8 bytes, reversed] and was verified.

  Microsoft-b03f5f7f11d50a3a  System.Collections.Immutable, System.Reflection.Metadata, MSBuild ...
  Open-cc7b13ffcd2ddd51       System.Memory, System.Buffers, most dotnet/runtime OOB packages
  MSShared-31bf3856ad364e35   Microsoft.CodeAnalysis*, NuGet? (MSSharedLib1024)

Convert: xxd -r -p NAME.pubkey.hex > NAME.snk
  MicrosoftAspNetCore-adb9793829ddae60  Microsoft.Extensions.* (dotnet/runtime); taken from
                              the PublicKey= text of InternalsVisibleTo attributes in the
                              runtime-8.0.0 sources (21 occurrences), token verified
  Newtonsoft-30ad4fe6b2a6aeed Newtonsoft.Json; from the PublicKey= text of an InternalsVisibleTo
                              attribute in Newtonsoft.Json 13.0.3's Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs
                              (the in-repo Dynamic.snk key pair is not used)
  ECMA-b77a5c561934e089       the 16-byte "ECMA standard" pseudo key of mscorlib/System and
                              friends (it is defined by ECMA-335, not a real RSA key)
  SilverlightPlatform-7cec85d7bea7798e  System.Private.CoreLib and the other "platform" assemblies
                              (StrongNameKeyId SilverlightPlatform); from the PublicKey text in
                              runtime-8.0.0 System.Private.DataContractSerialization Globals.cs
                              (FullSRSInternalsVisiblePattern), token verified
  Cecil-50cebf1cceb9d05e      Mono.Cecil* (dotnet/cecil, for illink); from the Consts.PublicKey text in
                              Mono.Cecil/Consts.cs, token verified (the in-repo cecil.snk key pair is not used)
